  "body_html": "<h2>How to Use This Index</h2><p><strong>First time here?</strong> Skim the <a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/about\">about page</a> to understand me and this newsletter, then my <a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/i/161889914/investment-philosophy\">investment philosophy</a>, dive into <a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/i/161889914/deepdive-stock-analyses\">deep‑dives</a>, <a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/i/161889914/weeklies\">weeklies</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/i/161889914/weekly-investment-fundamentals\">investing fundamentals</a>. </p><p>Paid subscribers can access paid content <a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/i/161889914/paid-subscribers\">here</a>.</p><p>Questions? Comment below or email <a href=\"mailto:george@beatingthetide.com\">george@beatingthetide.com</a><strong>.</strong></p><div><hr></div><h2>📚 Investment Philosophy </h2><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/i/154689525/lets-invest-like-professional-poker-players\">Let’s invest like professional poker players</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/i/159619277/thought-of-the-week-storytelling-is-a-double-edged-sword-so-be-careful\">Storytelling is a double-edged sword, so be careful</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/i/161243429/thought-of-the-week-invest-in-what-you-understand\">Invest in What You Understand</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/p/george-atuan-why-ignoring-market-noise\">Why Ignoring Market Noise Pays Off</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/i/156817947/thought-of-the-week-thinking-fast-and-slow\">Thinking, Fast and Slow</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/i/159155344/thought-of-the-week-why-you-should-aim-to-make-a-living-rather-than-making-a-killing\">Why you should aim to make a living rather than making a killing</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/i/158203795/thought-of-the-week-no-place-for-emotions-in-stock-investing\">No Place for Emotions in Stock Investing</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/i/161645056/thought-of-the-week-what-does-it-mean-for-a-market-to-be-efficient-and-why-it-matters-for-stock-investing\">What Does It Mean for a Market to Be Efficient? (And Why It Matters for Stock Investing)</a></p></li></ul><div><hr></div><h2>🔎 Deep‑Dive Stock Analyses</h2><p><em>Full archive</em> → <a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/t/idea\">here</a>.</p><p>Reader favorite</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/p/george-atuan-the-dirt-on-a-quiet-compounder-hiding\">The Dirt on a Quiet Compounder Hiding in Plain Sight</a> (paid)</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/p/george-atuan-celestica-the-most-important-ai-stock\">Celestica: The Most Important AI Stock You’re Probably Not Aware Of</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/p/tsmc-stock-why-this-semiconductor\">TSMC Stock: Why This Semiconductor Giant is My Highest-Conviction Buy</a></p></li></ul><div><hr></div><h2>🗓️ Weeklies</h2><p>Weekly recaps that separate signal from noise and explain how events move our open positions. <em>Browse the full archive →</em> <a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/t/weekly\">here</a>.</p><div><hr></div><h2>🛠️ Weekly Investment Fundamentals</h2><p>A technical companion newsletter on LinkedIn, “<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/newsletters/weekly-investing-fundamentals-7298749164488642560/\">Weekly Investing Fundamentals</a>,” covering the <em>how</em> of investing </p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/balance-sheet-primer-your-stocks-financial-x-ray-net-atuan-cfa-rggxc/?trackingId=LrwHE7SmR1CbyEVNbYSDAA%3D%3D\">The Balance Sheet Primer: Your Stock’s Financial X-Ray and Hidden Safety Net</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/how-spot-red-flags-stocks-ounce-skepticism-worth-pound-atuan-cfa-mhwvc/?trackingId=kXwUH%2FWjT8OR1932flw0VA%3D%3D\">How to Spot Red Flags in Stocks — An Ounce of Skepticism is Worth a Pound of Future Regret</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/art-science-reading-10-ks-proxy-statements-primer-george-atuan-cfa-knc0c/?trackingId=Hp78SEVDTOGRTGA5RTWS%2Fw%3D%3D\">The Art (and Science) of Reading 10-Ks and Proxy Statements - A Primer</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/most-important-metric-youre-probably-using-george-atuan-cfa-uwjnc/?trackingId=AFXwBXm9Qy%2BoOWpDOCv6BQ%3D%3D\">The Most Important Metric You’re Probably Not Using</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/how-stock-market-really-worksmaster-rules-get-george-atuan-cfa-nsmuf/?trackingId=stE6%2FCR0TtK3BIwpURQsCg%3D%3D\">How the Stock Market Really Works—Master the Rules or Get Outplayed</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/secret-outsmarting-market-leverage-your-competitive-george-atuan-cfa-br5zf/?trackingId=lFSDbGuCS1O4o%2FXJPCwuTA%3D%3D\">The Secret to Outsmarting the Market: Leverage Your Competitive Advantage in Investing</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/why-most-investors-fail-one-skill-you-need-succeed-george-atuan-rvftc/?trackingId=snNBwhTjTjO%2FtivMLL%2Bdcw%3D%3D\">Why Most Investors Fail: The One Skill You Need to Succeed</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/unpopular-profitable-why-contrarian-investors-outsmart-george-atuan-mqolc/?trackingId=QLn3eKA6RRqbpnqun95FJg%3D%3D\">Unpopular But Profitable: Why Contrarian Investors Outsmart the Herd</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/why-your-reading-list-more-important-than-watchlist-george-atuan-8huhf/?trackingId=UqHB8OM6SwmFMr4Feckz5Q%3D%3D\">Why Your Reading List Is More Important Than Your Watchlist</a></p></li></ul><div><hr></div><h2>💳 Paid subscribers</h2><p>You can access the current holdings and weights below:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/p/svif-usa-portfolio?r=1el2t9&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web&amp;triedRedirect=true\">Global portfolio</a></p></li></ul><p>Also, the weekly stock performance can be found <a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/p/weekly-stock-performance-tracker\">here</a>, this should be read alongside the Weekly.</p><div><hr></div><h2>🤝 Community &amp; Extras</h2><ul><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/leaderboard\">Referral Rewards</a></strong> – The more referrals, the higher the rewards. Ensure to use your personalized link found <a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/leaderboard\">here</a>.</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!V1U_!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff850038e-e28c-4480-82da-88187c0c4ae8_518x175.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!V1U_!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff850038e-e28c-4480-82da-88187c0c4ae8_518x175.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!V1U_!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff850038e-e28c-4480-82da-88187c0c4ae8_518x175.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!V1U_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff850038e-e28c-4480-82da-88187c0c4ae8_518x175.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!V1U_!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff850038e-e28c-4480-82da-88187c0c4ae8_518x175.png\" width=\"518\" height=\"175